# * GUITAR CHECK: acoustic guitar on the guitar stem in every section and no
#   electric reading anywhere -- the listening model's electric guitar is
#   described as at most a clean, lightly amplified or semi-acoustic guitar,
#   never a distorted one, in the writer's notes and in INSTRUMENTATION (a folk-rock test
